                # into the reaper - and the reaper's kill is what leaves the
                # launcher `interrupted`, whose only documented cure destroys
                # the database. So the honest answer here is also the safe one:
                # wait, do not start a second time, and say how to watch.
                ok "The database is already starting — give it a moment."
                info "Watch it come up with: exakit status   (it answers 'running' when ready)"
